        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾Game Introduction: The Journey of Tera, the Orb-Seeking Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the kingdom of cats, four elemental clans—Water, Fire, Earth, and Air—once lived together in harmony.<br>But one day, a Water-elemental cat corrupted by dark magic attacked the Earth clan, shattering the balance of the realm.<br>Since that day, the Water cats were cast out and forgotten by society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, a full-scale war breaks out between the Fire, Earth, and Air clans. The land becomes ravaged by endless conflict.<br>Then, a lone Water cat appears on the battlefield. Sacrificing itself, it casts a powerful spell that halts the war—<br>only to vanish, transformed into a single magical orb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That orb shattered into fragments scattered across the kingdom, along with a prophecy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;When a pure-hearted Water cat gathers all the fragments, peace will return to the feline realm.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Tera</strong>, a banished Water cat, on a journey to collect the pieces of the magical orb and restore peace to the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Easy keyboard input makes it accessible for everyone to play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Graphics &amp; Characters</strong>: Charming art style and cute feline characters will steal your heart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Around 1 hour of engaging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Map Design</strong>: Explore uniquely structured maps, find your path, and unlock new areas!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🐾Game Introduction: The Journey of Tera, the Orb-Seeking Cat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the kingdom of cats, four elemental clans—Water, Fire, Earth, and Air—once lived together in harmony.<br>But one day, a Water-elemental cat corrupted by dark magic attacked the Earth clan, shattering the balance of the realm.<br>Since that day, the Water cats were cast out and forgotten by society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years later, a full-scale war breaks out between the Fire, Earth, and Air clans. The land becomes ravaged by endless conflict.<br>Then, a lone Water cat appears on the battlefield. Sacrificing itself, it casts a powerful spell that halts the war—<br>only to vanish, transformed into a single magical orb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That orb shattered into fragments scattered across the kingdom, along with a prophecy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;When a pure-hearted Water cat gathers all the fragments, peace will return to the feline realm.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Tera</strong>, a banished Water cat, on a journey to collect the pieces of the magical orb and restore peace to the kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong>: Easy keyboard input makes it accessible for everyone to play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Graphics &amp; Characters</strong>: Charming art style and cute feline characters will steal your heart!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime</strong>: Around 1 hour of engaging gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied Map Design</strong>: Explore uniquely structured maps, find your path, and unlock new areas!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Jump, dodge, and claw your way through a cute and chaotic world in Terra!This casual platformer is packed with tricky platforms, weird monsters, and lovable characters. Can Terra make it through the obstacles and collect every last Magic Orb?",
